03", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003251_774312788169636_8407136546126498352_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=TJEZQyKNl-QQ7kNvwGrJ7Jr&_nc_oc=Ado7WRA1OvbYXCv15JZUlvi8l8vnzIcBMoj3uS7CrFNNg-IqGMbF_e6EUKCPBlgVCSA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af95jRPp6AtBPHiNqkjiomph2Ogy6Fltekt6YDm-nihCVA&oe=6A2BFE26"}]}, "id": "1377969980485338", "locale": "en_US", "screenshots": [{"file_name": "SC26.png", "id": "964420118677466", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031510_964420125344132_7279037948266946186_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=W-r3W4oP_IYQ7kNvwGwwsE3&_nc_oc=AdpmM-qzw8WM4VPlN7bipPN0rLmu5G0hUAZiL51t4ivXVk_5O2XcKt7UaA626ErOBBg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-8BGcKE2w3LeHR0a47u-rDUrsrK2uvbA8e-4hll1Suvg&oe=6A2C0945"}, {"file_name": "SC19.png", "id": "1028550412168366", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031459_1028550415501699_7667063941983084531_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5rKw5J6weCMQ7kNvwE-n7Nc&_nc_oc=AdoDRDWcU7xrBO_BfpnYjTUon1qGAsgb82fsjd9-1YtXJaucEqLnwt76ZV7VX8Ya_EQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8_l7qpU6NHGFkmJp2FrQ3NLrYhKwo-V2elfDXEQ8LWRg&oe=6A2C06EC"}, {"file_name": "SC6.png", "id": "1213008986735069", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982453_1213008990068402_721949442093583782_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Oyc4Ja5mNtsQ7kNvwEczdt3&_nc_oc=AdpCLcHWM8Z8GND2dN0I6JzQvOu6eeq8TRdQ1QyrChW6cx4jA1FVhujaScUK_yRzR8w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-RYqIBDaqojcDIStuSFva8AuK1MYU9euU3z8PsXLZh5w&oe=6A2C1AA0"}, {"file_name": "SC25.png", "id": "2182709462063835", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031547_2182709465397168_1136481695964559917_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=IK2MIKQITBIQ7kNvwFcqbgo&_nc_oc=Adp6y4GTLIqOfyH6LpAVbmQ-nIjoUL8SrHju8CSbaj4kMER4B6hWp8kLEolzwY8a-pc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-Mn4S2zSs26YWuUnSH1l_pl_KbVGKgnQC7bWzqQn_SWw&oe=6A2C0FB6"}, {"file_name": "SC11.png", "id": "1020526033014243", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75250452_1020526036347576_3573329723363051043_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xz-B0-B4zKgQ7kNvwHOKNDE&_nc_oc=AdpCOqiFwnvg_n2ilfRFkzBxJm5Fc52b7NJU-uE4LBGJ1KWuYxgpPCHNNshmK6ualm4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_4oKJeWUOuPHgfDzPr_eOTbJqQGJgW4ybeqgIskBMTTA&oe=6A2C052F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "TrailerCover.png", "id": "1670277503511368", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974650_1670277506844701_2413630122857125207_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Fh0TOZEnGO8Q7kNvwFP5z2N&_nc_oc=AdoJbSW0UwoP5aB-fon0NEaDPKemYFUFmxIviuJWcT-jSUjUAYGj_8hUy2rc72iIhKY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9cbwEWuCruh903aNtBevI6FrBif_I8vhnYA66ZIWr5Lw&oe=6A2C15D5"}, "display_name": "Venture's Gauntlet: Ultimate VR Fitness", "keywords": ["fitness", "adventure", "obstacle", "story", "platformer"], "long_description": "# VR's Ultimate Action-Platformer\n\nObsessed with his family's legacy, aging billionaire Adam Venture is looking for a capable heir to the Venture name and fortune. His only requirement? The skill and tenacity to overcome a series of deadly obstacle courses known as: **Venture\u2019s Gauntlet**\n\n{960204795511693}\n\n# Comfortable Locomotion \n\nRun, climb, swing and zipline your way through the gauntlet in comfort and style with **TrueMotionVR** arm swing controls.\n\n\n# Overcome Dangerous Challenges\n\nKiller-drones, deadly lasers, fatal drops and more all stand along the path to glory. Only the most capable will survive.\n\n{472666925095689}\n\n# Embark On An Epic Journey\n\nTraverse giant cliffs, delve into the depths of the earth and climb crumbling castles across 9 intense stages inspired by the Highlands of Scotland.\n\n{2173852816328585}\n\n# Breathtaking Visuals\n\nExperience beautiful graphics powered by Unreal Engine. A dynamic time of day and weather system makes the world feel alive as you progress through the Gauntlet.\n\n{408266168650091}\n\n# Uncover the secrets of the Ventures\n\nThe ever-present Adam Venture watches your every move. Do you have the skill to impress him, or will you be a disappointment like all the others?\n\n{1446632349279537}\n\n# Tailor Made Courses\n\nCalibration adjusts the Gauntlet\u2019s obstacles to your height & arm length measurements to ensure the best experience for all users.\n\n# Claim the ultimate glory\n\nCompete against other players for the best times on each stage on the online leaderboards.\n\nSo ask yourself this -  do **YOU** have what it takes to run the Gauntlet?\n\nWe think you can do it!!\n\n\n\n\n\n\n", "short_description": "Venture\u2019s Gauntlet is an intense parkour & obstacle course game that features arm swing movement, climbing, archery, moving lasers, shooter drones, shields, and more.  \n\nPlaying the game is an immersive physical experience, a test of both fitness and skill because you are the one running, climbing, and dodging through challenging courses!  \n\nKiller-drones, deadly lasers, fatal drops and more all stand along the path to glory. Only the most capable will survive and claim Adam Venture's fortune.\n\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://bearhammergames.com/privacypolicy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://bearhammergames.com/eula/", "publisher_name": "BearHammer Games Ltd", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://bearhammergames.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_FEW", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id"